/// Axis slot of a conjugacy class in the canonical orientation.
/// kPrincipal = the class of the maximal-order proper rotation (ties:
/// the class-minimal power first, then the lexicographically smallest
/// canonical axis), plus the sigma/improper classes on that axis;
/// kOrbitN = the N-th orbit among same-(kind, order, power) classes
